# ─── Email Configuration ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# DEMO MODE (default — no configuration needed):
#   Leave all SMTP_ variables commented out. The server will auto-create a free
#   Ethereal test account and print a preview URL for each email in the console.
#   Emails are NOT delivered to real inboxes in demo mode.
#
# PRODUCTION MODE (send real emails):
#   Uncomment and fill in the variables below for your mail provider.
#   Works with Gmail, Outlook, SendGrid, Mailgun, etc.
#

# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_SECURE=false
# SMTP_USER=your-email@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASS=your-app-password
# SMTP_FROM="Claim Relay <noreply@yourcompany.com>"

# ─── Gmail Quick Setup ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Enable 2-Factor Authentication on your Google account
# 2. Go to https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Create an App Password (name it "Claim Relay")
# 4. Use that 16-character password as SMTP_PASS (not your regular password)
# 5. Set SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com, SMTP_PORT=587, SMTP_SECURE=false
# 6. Copy this file to .env and fill in the values
